  "configs": [
   "L_30_45",
   "R_080",
   "alpha_repo",
   "noise_001"
  ],
  "spread_within_a_seed": 0.0,
  "what_it_shows": "these configurations hold the repository's own value on their own axis, so they are the same simulator under different names. Within one seed they agree to the digit, which is why the spread across seeds can be read as the draw and nothing else."
 },
